<section class="content">

<h3>Verse to Memorize</h3>

<div class="bible-passage">
<p>&laquo;Long ago God spoke to our ancestors in many and various ways by the prophets, but in these last days he has spoken to us by a Son.&raquo;</p>
<p class="bible-passage__ref">&mdash; Hebrews 1:1-2</p>
</div>

</section>

<section class="content">

<h3>Prayer for This Week</h3>

<blockquote>
<p>Lord, you who spoke to Moses from the burning bush,<br />
and to Saint Paul on the road to Damascus,<br />
speak to me as well.<br />
Open my ears to hear your voice,<br />
my eyes to recognize your passing,<br />
and my heart to answer like Moses: &laquo;Here I am.&raquo;<br />
You who are the eternal Word of the Father,<br />
teach me to know you and love you.<br />
Amen.</p>
</blockquote>

